{
  "version": "stethofuse-clinical-targets-v2",
  "declared_utc": "2026-11-20",
  "declaration": "v2 adds a frozen PANNs CNN14 embedding arm and the rule that the gate cannot activate while any declared dataset is missing. Pass bars, split seed, test fraction and targets are unchanged from v1. Declared before any v2 result was computed. v1 evidence remains as recorded. Added before any COPD or pneumonia result: those cohorts keep only patients in the supported age groups, because ICBHI's healthy group includes children while COPD patients are adults (age would otherwise be a shortcut).",
